256" "723a3905b77c613d5d439d20eb56e456d44fea25808fdc171fc24134857c48b2" "basis" 1243 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14033859/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-124259" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "5"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14033859/state.json" "file_sha256" "723a3905b77c613d5d439d20eb56e456d44fea25808fdc171fc24134857c48b2" "basis" 1243 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14033859/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-124301" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "The matrix form of the affine transformation\n\n$$\nx=6u-v,\\,y=2u-3v+4\n$$\n\nis shown below. What is the value of $a+b+c?$\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}a & -1 \\\\ 2 & b\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}u \\\\ v\\end{aligned}]+[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ c\\end{aligned}]\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14033859/state.json" "file_sha256" "723a3905b77c613d5d439d20eb56e456d44fea25808fdc171fc24134857c48b2" "basis" 1243 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14033859/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-124301" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "An affine transformation $T:{R}^{2}\\to {R}^{2}$ is a function of the form\n\n$$\nx=Au+b,\n$$\n\nwhere $x,u,$ and $b$ are column vectors in ${R}^{2},$ and $A$ is a $2\\times 2$ matrix.\n\nFirst, notice that we can express the given transformation as\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}6u-v \\\\ 2u-3v+4\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nSeparating the constants and expressing the linear part as a product, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}6u-v \\\\ 2u-3v+4\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}6u-v \\\\ 2u-3v\\end{aligned}]+[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & ={{[\\begin{aligned}6 & -1 \\\\ 2 & -3\\end{aligned}]}_{⏟}}_{A}\\cdot {{[\\begin{aligned}u \\\\ v\\end{aligned}]}_{⏟}}_{u}+{{[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}]}_{⏟}}_{b}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\na+b+c=6+(-3)+4=7.\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14033859/state.json" "file_sha256" "723a3905b77c613d5d439d20eb56e456d44fea25808fdc171fc24134857c48b2" "basis" 1243 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14033859/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-124301" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14033859/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "f878c5d873ff6311da3dc9245bc02e778b68b66ad92843dae863dbce586c6dbd" "basis" 1243 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14033859/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-124301" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14033859/state.json" "file_sha256" "723a3905b77c613d5d439d20eb56e456d44fea25808fdc171fc24134857c48b2" "basis" 1243 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14033859/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-124301" "field" "selection" "attribute" 